00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.001 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Halle and I are about

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
to play
a game of Sticky Balls,

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
which refers, of course,
to these balls

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:06.473
which stick to these
Velcro suits that we're wearing.

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:08.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
We are going to put
45 seconds on the clock

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:10.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then throw these
sticky balls at one anothe

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:11.378 size:75% position:38% line:92%
until time runs out.

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:13.546 align:start size:94% position:6%
Once we're done,
Halle and I will each coun

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
the sticky balls
stuck to the other person.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:18.451
The one with the most ball
stuck to their suits loses

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.519 align:start size:94% position:6%
The first ball thrown
has to be

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:21.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
one of the balls
in the center line.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:23.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
No crossing over
into the other person's court,

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:24.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
and absolutely
no removing of balls

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:27.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
